        "leaf": "260928-MIK-L51"
      },
      "rationale": "Reports a listed consumer whose file does not exist and names the write command where the command repairs the row, and reports a row whose artifact file does not exist with the note that the command removes no row; for a row whose every listed consumer is gone and which the source tree does not support, the finding says that the command does not repair the row. So a line or row that a union brought back for a deleted file is refused without an over-widening claim.",
      "role": "enforcement"
    }
